# Build & deployment (MyWallet)

Workspace root: `/home/nvnhan0810/www/wallets.nvnhan0810.com`  
Live host: `https://wallets.nvnhan0810.com`  
K8s: namespace `wallets-nvnhan0810-com`, label `app.kubernetes.io/name=wallets-nvnhan0810-com`

Image is built from Dockerfile (assets baked in). For **local** Blade/JS verification against a volume-mounted or rebuilt image:

1. **Build FE:** `npm run build` in the workspace root.
2. **OPcache:** delete pod so PHP reloads views when the runtime mounts this tree:
   - `kubectl delete pod -l app.kubernetes.io/name=wallets-nvnhan0810-com -n wallets-nvnhan0810-com`
   - `sleep 15 && kubectl get pods -n wallets-nvnhan0810-com`
3. **Verify:** `curl -s https://wallets.nvnhan0810.com/login | grep ...`

Production updates normally go through the GHCR image (`ghcr.io/nvnhan0810/wallets:...`) via deploy webhook — push/rebuild when the running pod does not mount this directory.
